The `.vscode/` trees and Monaco `dist/` fixture are upstream development-only
files ignored by the vendored tree's own ignore rules; they are not required
to build or run Review Desktop. Their dangling postinstall targets are removed
from `build/npm/dirs.ts`, and their dangling TypeScript compilations are
removed from `build/gulpfile.extensions.ts`. Review also keeps the remote and
default-test source while omitting their unused package installs.

